        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARBEL, Parthenon Plate with Bellagio Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor an authentic building restoration, or simply to achieve a distinctive and romantic touch, Grandeur's Parthenon Plate With Bellagio Lever makes a profound statement in luxury. Its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home décors. The Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. This Grandeur made Parthenon Plate With Bellagio Door Lever will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARBEL Parthenon Plate With Bellagio Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Plate With Bellagio Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BEL-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Bellagio Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bellagio Lever with Parthenon Plate",
                "description": "Parthenon Plate With Bellagio Lever Grandeur PARBEL - For an authentic building restoration, or simply to achieve a distinctive and romantic touch, Grandeur's Parthenon Plate With Bellagio Lever makes a profound statement in luxury. Its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home décors. The Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. This Grandeur made Parthenon Plate With Bellagio Door Lever will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
